        "selector": {
          "type": "FragmentSelector",
          "value": "xywh=pixel:678.4999389648438,2814.26611328125,4065.5357055664062,2415.40283203125",
          "conformsTo": "http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/"
        }
      },
      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Verso",
          "value": "<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<ol><li>buy the wheat for my provisions only because I had a large amount deposited in .... I sold silk that was</li>\n<li>with me. My lord Ab\u016b l-Faraj Yeshua\u02bf will inform you... As for what you asked about customs,</li>\n<li>I have sent the aloeswood with Ab\u016b l-Khayr. I hope they arrive safely. My letter</li>\n<li>will reach you after that, with an explanation of additional news about the ships. They came to us</li>\n<li>... I hope, God willing, that they have moved. I send the most perfect greetings to you. To my lord Ab\u016b l-Faraj,</li>\n<li>your son-in-law, I send perfect greetings. To my master the Rav, perfect greetings. To my lord Ab\u016b Sulaym\u0101n D\u0101w\u016bd and his young man, perfect greetings.</li>\n<li>To my lord Ab\u016b l-Faraj Yeshua\u02bf, if he is present, perfect greetings. My brother Avraham sends perfect greetings to all of you.</li>\n<li>I have sent you one d\u012bn\u0101r of al-Mahdiyya from what was paid to Ibn Sham\u02bf\u016bn/Shim\u02bfon, and 3 d\u012bn\u0101rs of&nbsp;Aleppo with Yonah. I have informed you of this. Peace.</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
      "motivation": [
        "sc:supplementing",
        "translating"
      ],
      "schema:position": 1
    },
